                <Placemark>
                    <name>Burtt &amp; Sons, E. R. Burtt limeworks, and E. R. Burtt</name>
                    <description><![CDATA[Burtt &amp; Sons, E. R. Burtt limeworks, and E. R. Burtt<br>Kilns were built to turn limestone with the fossils it contained into the quick lime that was used in mortar for building. The lime works of E.R. Burtt were founded here in 1816.<br>Burgess Park, Albany Road<br>London]]></description>
                    <Point>
                        <coordinates>-0.08797,51.48215,0</coordinates>
