                <Placemark>
                    <name>George Edwards</name>
                    <description><![CDATA[George Edwards<br>Sir George Edwards 1908 - 2003 The internationally famous aircraft designer, who was responsible for both the Concorde and the Vickers Viscount, was born here, above his fathers toyshop. As a boy he attended the nearby Selwyn Avenue school<br>499 Hale End Road, Highams Park E4<br>London]]></description>
