                    <name>Robert Boothby-Heathcote, Friday Hill House, and Lewis Vulliamy</name>
                    <description><![CDATA[Robert Boothby-Heathcote, Friday Hill House, and Lewis Vulliamy<br>Friday Hill House. Grade II Listed building. Designed by Lewis Vulliamy and erected in 1839, Friday Hill House was the last Manor house of Chingford Earls and home of the Boothby-Heathcote family<br>Friday Hill House, Simmons Lane E4<br>London]]></description>
