                    <description><![CDATA[plaque № 9662<br>Sunnyside Lodge. Locally Listed building. The former gatekeeper’s lodge to “Sunnyside”, a substantial mid 19thC house of 10 bedrooms, over the site of which Woodberry Way and Sunnyside Drive were laid out in the 1920’s and 30’s<br>73 Woodberry Way, Chingford E4<br>London]]></description>
