                    <description><![CDATA[Henry Cole<br>Sir Henry Cole lived here 1879-1880. He originated the custom of sending Christmas Cards and was largely responsible for the foundation of the Kensington Museum. He was also a great postal reformer.<br>Elm Row, Hampstead<br>Hampstead Plaque Fund]]></description>
