                    <description><![CDATA[Dido Elizabeth Belle and William Murray, 1st Earl of Mansfield<br>Dido Elizabeth Belle 1761-1804 Born into slavery, Belle was entrusted to her uncle William Murray, 1st Earl of Mansfield. She was educated and brought up as a gentlewoman at Kenwood. Lord Mansfield confirmed her freedom and provided her with an outright sum and an annuity, making her a heiress.<br>Kenwood House, Hampstead Lane, Highgate<br>Highgate Heritage 2019]]></description>
