                <Placemark>
                    <name>plaque № 10278</name>
                    <description><![CDATA[plaque № 10278<br>1914-1919 This plaque was placed here on Sunday 4 June 2000 by members of the Anglo-German Family History Society to remember over 17,000 German and other civilian prisoners of war interned at Alexandra Palace between 1914 and 1919, in particular those who died during that period<br>Alexandra Palace, N22<br>Anglo-German Family History Society]]></description>
