                    <description><![CDATA[St Botolph without Aldersgate, London and Guild &amp; Church Ward of St Botolph-without-Aldersgate, London<br>Guild &amp; Church Ward of St Botolph-without-Aldersgate A church building has stood here for nearly one thousand yeards. The present building dates back to 1788-91. More important than the age or beauty of the building, however, is that Jesus Christ, and the message of his death and resurrection, is proclaimed here throughout the week.<br>Aldersgate Street<br>London]]></description>
