                <Placemark>
                    <name>7 July 2005 London bombings, Anthony Fatayi-Williams, Miriam Hyman, and 11 others</name>
                    <description><![CDATA[7 July 2005 London bombings, Anthony Fatayi-Williams, Miriam Hyman, and 11 others<br>In memory of those who were killed in the bomb attack on a route 30 bus near this spot on 7th July 2005. Anthony Fatayi-Williams, Miriam Hyman, Anat Rosenberg, Jamie Gordon, Shahara Akhter Islam, Philip Stuart Russell, Giles Vernon Hart, Neetu Jain, William Wise, Marie Joanne Hartley, Sam Ly, Gladys Wundowa, Shayanuja Parathasangary. London will not forget them and all those who suffered that day.<br>Tavistock Square<br>London]]></description>
