                    <name>Cesar Ritz</name>
                    <description><![CDATA[Cesar Ritz<br>This hotel, inspired by Cesar Ritz, designed by Charles Mèwes &amp; Arthur Davis, opened on 25th May 1906<br>150 Piccadilly<br>London]]></description>
