                    <name>Luigi Manze</name>
                    <description><![CDATA[Luigi Manze<br>Manze's Pie &amp; Mash Shop. Locally listed building. Originally from Ravello in Italy, the Manze family emigrated to England in 1878 and founded an empire of fourteen pie &amp; mash shops across London. In 1929 Luigi Manze rebuilt 76 High Street in its present form.<br>L Manze Eel, Pie and Mash Shop, Walthamstow High Street<br>Waltham Forest Council]]></description>
