                <Placemark>
                    <name>C. J. Phipps and Eleonora Duse</name>
                    <description><![CDATA[C. J. Phipps and Eleonora Duse<br>Lyric Theatre Built by C J Phipps. The Lyric Theatre opened in 1888 with the comic opera "Dorothy" and has since developed a tradition of drama, light comedy and popular musicals. The great Italian actress Eleonora Duse made her debut here in "Camille" in 1893<br>Shaftesbury Ave<br>City of Westminster]]></description>
