                <Placemark>
                    <name>St. Dunstan's College</name>
                    <description><![CDATA[St. Dunstan's College<br>In 1466 the School attached to the church of St. Dunstan in the East was one of five recognised grammar schools in the City of London. The boys independent school of St. Dunstan's College was founded at Catford in 1888 on land owned by the parish of St. Dunstan in the East<br>St Dunstan’s Hill<br>St Dunstan's College 1983]]></description>
