                <Placemark>
                    <name>Arthur Harris</name>
                    <description><![CDATA[Arthur Harris<br>Marshall of the Royal Air Force Sir Arthur Harris BT GCB OBE AFC In memory of a great Commander and of the brave crews of Bomber Command. More than 55,000 of whom lost their lives in the cause of freedom. The nation owes them all an immense debt.<br>Statue of Arthur Harris - St Clement Danes - Strand<br>London]]></description>
