                <Placemark>
                    <name>Noël Coward</name>
                    <description><![CDATA[Noël Coward<br>Sir Noël Coward 1899-1973 dramatist, actor and composer lived for a few years of his childhood (1906-1909) in Lenham Road. His first public appearance on stage was on July 23rd 1907 in a concert at Sutton Public Hall when he was about 8 years old.<br>56 Lenham Road, Sutton<br>London]]></description>
