                <Placemark>
                    <name>Precision Film Studio</name>
                    <description><![CDATA[Precision Film Studio<br>The Precision Film Studio 1910-1915 On this site in early 1910 the Gobbett Brothers built for the Precision Film Company Limited the first of the Walthamstow film studios. This pioneering studio was the first of its type and its design would be much emulated throughout Britain.<br>Beuleigh Court, 280 Wood Street, Walthamstow<br>Waltham Forest Council 2017]]></description>
